    "body": "There's #1132 by @estark37 still which seems related. From that perspective it would make sense for CORS preflights not to be able to handle it I think. Though Private Network Access is reusing CORS preflights for navigations as well (exact layering TBD) at which point it probably should work?\r\n\r\nOverall I would not expect it to be different from the request following the preflight (if successful) so perhaps this is simply a field we should make sure to copy when setting up the preflight?",
